        "mode": "tldr",
        "content": "As of May 5, 2026 (run `20260505_220625`), the prior long position (id 117) was stopped out today at $101.00 (-$4.99 realized). Price fell to $100.48 (hourly) / $101.31 (daily). The April 30 breakout is fully invalidated. All short-term EMAs ($101.97\u2013$102.50) are overhead \u2014 price is below the entire EMA cluster. ADX 36.98 is elevated but +DI (26.02) and -DI (25.43) are nearly deadlocked, indicating chop. Hourly RSI-21 at 25.04 is deeply oversold; hourly Bollinger width 0.0404 is extremely tight (squeeze coiling). The stock is falling into the May 6 earnings binary. No open positions. No new entry authorized.\n\n---",
